Starting with (\ref{EG predescent}) with $\mu=0$ from monotonicity, we have
        \begin{align}
              \|x_{k+1}-y\|^2 &\leq \|x_k-y\|^2-(1-C_\nu^2)\|x_k-\hat{x}_k\|^2 - 2\gamma_k\left\langle F(y),\hat{x}_k-y\right\rangle \label{EG monotone predescent}
        \end{align}
