    &\leq \left( 1+\beta^{-1} \right)\|x_0-x^*\|^2+(1+\beta)r^2\|x_0-x^*\|^2 \\
    &=(1+r^2+\beta^{-1}+\beta r^2)\|x_0-x^*\|^2
\end{align*}
        We can readily find that the value for $\beta$ that minimizes this expression is $\beta=r^{-1}$, which gives us
        \begin{equation}
