                \frac{\nu}{\bar{\lambda}_N^0+\bar{\lambda}_N^1\left(  \|x_0-x^*\|(L_0+L_1\|F(x^*)\|)\exp(L_1\|x_0-x^*\|) + \|F(x^*)\| \right)} 
         \label{adaEG step lower bound}
