        where $\bar{\lambda}_N^0$ and $\bar{\lambda}_N^1$ are defined in Lemma~\ref{lem: finite while loops}

This result readily follows from Lemma~\ref{lem:EG step lower bound}. Specifically, note that from the assumed descent inequality, we can reuse the following intermediate inequality from Lemma~\ref{lem:EG step lower bound}:
